{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okay, I lied, I updated it. Here's what's new:</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A new Second Quest with 10 exploration focused levels and 37 exits (the Main Story only had 10 exits).</li><li>A new Randomizer with 10 levels that procedurally generate a new layout every time you play them.</li><li>Over a two dozen new objects including collectables, blocks, enemies, scene-wide effects, and light probes.</li><li>Underwater levels, oceans of poison, black holes, bomb rain, lava, and even more secrets.</li><li>New options for old objects including guide support and better logic handling.</li><li>Massive performance improvements enabling 240-360fps with thousands of objects and dynamic lighting.</li><li>Hundreds of bug fixes and small visual improvements.</li><li>Level sharing servers are still offline (only prevents level sharing via code).</li><li>Keeping the price at $3.</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm Bowser, a solo indie dev. I wanted to create something that exists somewhere between a game, a maker game, and a game engine, a toy box that can be enjoyed by casual players, skilled players, level designers, modders, rom hackers, and everyone in-between. Built from the ground up on a custom engine designed for level making and modding, with pixel perfect rendering, dynamic lighting, and a retro physics engine. Full game, not early access, no in-app purchases, no DLC, no AI, and I'm still updating it 2 years later.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support. Designed for cozy couch gaming. No mouse or keyboard needed.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/8addb114eedb1ff023e1e15fb74b67e0.poster.avif?t=1772497472\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/8addb114eedb1ff023e1e15fb74b67e0.webm?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/8addb114eedb1ff023e1e15fb74b67e0.mp4?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc2f Features \ud83d\udc2f</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Run, jump, swim, fly, carry, throw, and roll around in a vibrant world full of secrets.</li><li>Unique shake mechanic changes how you interact with your environment.</li><li>Includes a story mode with 10 levels.</li><li>Includes an in-game level editor.</li><li>Built on a custom game engine designed from the ground up for modding.</li><li>Includes an easy-to-use C# SDK, allowing anyone to create new objects.</li><li>High framerate support, up to 240Hz.</li><li>Achievements. Cloud saves.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc2f Editor Features \ud83d\udc2f</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build on a map 20x bigger than Super Mario Maker.</li><li>Build with no arbitrary limits on the number of objects.</li><li>Select from over 200 objects, with over 25 enemies, or make your own.</li><li>Place slopes, water, and decoration anywhere you want.</li><li>Place signs with text to guide the player or tell a story.</li><li>Place objects on different Z layers.</li><li>Design complex puzzles using switches, wires, and logic blocks.</li><li>Create atmosphere with colorful and interactive lighting.</li><li>Control the camera with rooms.</li><li>Mix and match different background layers.</li><li>Add weather effects and post-processing.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc2f Steam Workshop Features \ud83d\udc2f</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Subscribe to new objects, backgrounds, foregrounds, and other mods.</li><li>Easily publish your own creations to the Steam Workshop from within the game.</li><li>Package mods with levels to provide players with a rom-hack-like experience.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc2f Online Features \ud83d\udc2f</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Upload levels and share them using a code.</li><li>Browse uploaded levels on the Discord server.</li><li>You do not need to create an account and the game does not require an internet connection.</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To mod the game, extract Sdk.zip in the install directory and read GettingStarted.md. Most people can run their first mod within minutes.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/ebadd265d9bc89254b7d19af04838a6c.poster.avif?t=1772497472\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/ebadd265d9bc89254b7d19af04838a6c.webm?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/ebadd265d9bc89254b7d19af04838a6c.mp4?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/5dbff6381c92f0577bae4d983f801d2c.poster.avif?t=1772497472\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/5dbff6381c92f0577bae4d983f801d2c.webm?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/5dbff6381c92f0577bae4d983f801d2c.mp4?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/c3d0c9ca22c5c1040d21bd828a6b981b.poster.avif?t=1772497472\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/c3d0c9ca22c5c1040d21bd828a6b981b.webm?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/c3d0c9ca22c5c1040d21bd828a6b981b.mp4?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"bf23ba49e5554c5ca4210aad05582cc265d0d24f.jpg","localized_name":"Started Game","name":"Started Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1332260/bf23ba49e5554c5ca4210aad05582cc265d0d24f.jpg"},{"icon":"7d538c04dbff23de242c11a680c879c8bfd2709d.jpg","localized_name":"Viewed Ending","name":"Viewed Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1332260/7d538c04dbff23de242c11a680c879c8bfd2709d.jpg"},{"icon":"2a52c44e4c6616e47870df1b69f2d394d7156673.jpg","localized_name":"Viewed Credits","name":"Viewed Credits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1332260/2a52c44e4c6616e47870df1b69f2d394d7156673.jpg"},{"icon":"5b46abe424609f8767a1d21f32d0ccb5f0092653.jpg","localized_name":"Opened Editor","name":"Opened Editor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1332260/5b46abe424609f8767a1d21f32d0ccb5f0092653.jpg"},{"icon":"0d8b1d3e2a453da842c7b7bc1ac04588ddae6cf6.jpg","localized_name":"Installed Mod","name":"Installed Mod","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1332260/0d8b1d3e2a453da842c7b7bc1ac04588ddae6cf6.jpg"},{"icon":"ace5448e14383ccc63a477c018317aee1f1d8c04.jpg","localized_name":"Started Save","name":"Started Save","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1332260/ace5448e14383ccc63a477c018317aee1f1d8c04.jpg"},{"icon":"1b4c2ad6e55d91209d0bfcc1080bab7373c999a3.jpg","localized_name":"Used Scene Code","name":"Used Scene Code","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1332260/1b4c2ad6e55d91209d0bfcc1080bab7373c999a3.jpg"},{"icon":"f182e15365d5846186653a2b11291a73e350c81d.jpg","localized_name":"Found Mapper","name":"Found Mapper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1332260/f182e15365d5846186653a2b11291a73e350c81d.jpg"},{"icon":"ff9942e7e1690ac0804f0ab4b7ae29779919a68a.jpg","localized_name":"Greedy Tiger","name":"Greedy Tiger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1332260/ff9942e7e1690ac0804f0ab4b7ae29779919a68a.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1332260?t=1772497472","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772497472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772497472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772497472","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okay, I lied, I updated it. Here's what's new:</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A new Second Quest with 10 exploration focused levels and 37 exits (the Main Story only had 10 exits).</li><li>A new Randomizer with 10 levels that procedurally generate a new layout every time you play them.</li><li>Over a two dozen new objects including collectables, blocks, enemies, scene-wide effects, and light probes.</li><li>Underwater levels, oceans of poison, black holes, bomb rain, lava, and even more secrets.</li><li>New options for old objects including guide support and better logic handling.</li><li>Massive performance improvements enabling 240-360fps with thousands of objects and dynamic lighting.</li><li>Hundreds of bug fixes and small visual improvements.</li><li>Level sharing servers are still offline (only prevents level sharing via code).</li><li>Keeping the price at $3.</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm Bowser, a solo indie dev. I wanted to create something that exists somewhere between a game, a maker game, and a game engine, a toy box that can be enjoyed by casual players, skilled players, level designers, modders, rom hackers, and everyone in-between. Built from the ground up on a custom engine designed for level making and modding, with pixel perfect rendering, dynamic lighting, and a retro physics engine. Full game, not early access, no in-app purchases, no DLC, no AI, and I'm still updating it 2 years later.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support. Designed for cozy couch gaming. No mouse or keyboard needed.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/8addb114eedb1ff023e1e15fb74b67e0.poster.avif?t=1772497472\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/8addb114eedb1ff023e1e15fb74b67e0.webm?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/8addb114eedb1ff023e1e15fb74b67e0.mp4?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc2f Features \ud83d\udc2f</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Run, jump, swim, fly, carry, throw, and roll around in a vibrant world full of secrets.</li><li>Unique shake mechanic changes how you interact with your environment.</li><li>Includes a story mode with 10 levels.</li><li>Includes an in-game level editor.</li><li>Built on a custom game engine designed from the ground up for modding.</li><li>Includes an easy-to-use C# SDK, allowing anyone to create new objects.</li><li>High framerate support, up to 240Hz.</li><li>Achievements. Cloud saves.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc2f Editor Features \ud83d\udc2f</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build on a map 20x bigger than Super Mario Maker.</li><li>Build with no arbitrary limits on the number of objects.</li><li>Select from over 200 objects, with over 25 enemies, or make your own.</li><li>Place slopes, water, and decoration anywhere you want.</li><li>Place signs with text to guide the player or tell a story.</li><li>Place objects on different Z layers.</li><li>Design complex puzzles using switches, wires, and logic blocks.</li><li>Create atmosphere with colorful and interactive lighting.</li><li>Control the camera with rooms.</li><li>Mix and match different background layers.</li><li>Add weather effects and post-processing.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc2f Steam Workshop Features \ud83d\udc2f</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Subscribe to new objects, backgrounds, foregrounds, and other mods.</li><li>Easily publish your own creations to the Steam Workshop from within the game.</li><li>Package mods with levels to provide players with a rom-hack-like experience.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc2f Online Features \ud83d\udc2f</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Upload levels and share them using a code.</li><li>Browse uploaded levels on the Discord server.</li><li>You do not need to create an account and the game does not require an internet connection.</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To mod the game, extract Sdk.zip in the install directory and read GettingStarted.md. Most people can run their first mod within minutes.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/ebadd265d9bc89254b7d19af04838a6c.poster.avif?t=1772497472\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/ebadd265d9bc89254b7d19af04838a6c.webm?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/ebadd265d9bc89254b7d19af04838a6c.mp4?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/5dbff6381c92f0577bae4d983f801d2c.poster.avif?t=1772497472\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/5dbff6381c92f0577bae4d983f801d2c.webm?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/5dbff6381c92f0577bae4d983f801d2c.mp4?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/c3d0c9ca22c5c1040d21bd828a6b981b.poster.avif?t=1772497472\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/c3d0c9ca22c5c1040d21bd828a6b981b.webm?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/extras/c3d0c9ca22c5c1040d21bd828a6b981b.mp4?t=1772497472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Protosprite"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332260/header.jpg?t=1772497472","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Rec